{
  "description": "Shared vectors for the hidden-character predicate. packet_hidden: indexes that the packet validators refuse (tab, LF and CR allowed). framed and removed: the lines and the count of removed characters that relayed-text framing gives (str.splitlines, then '| ' per line). Every copy of the predicate must give these answers.",
